### Page 1 of 3

```text
MEMORANDUM
TO:

Mayor Patrick Collins, and City Council
FROM:

TJ Barttelbort, Purchasing Manager
DATE:

May 22, 2024
SUBJECT:
Consideration of Bid #E-20-24 for One (1) New 2024-2025, 19,500 GVWR, Cab
& Chassis With 45 Foot Aerial Device Body
 ______________________________________________
Bid #E-20-24 was solicited for One (1) New 2024-2025, 19,500 GVWR, Cab & Chassis With 45
Foot Aerial Device Body for the Traffic Division.
One (1) bidder responded to this bid, and the bid tabulation is attached.  The Bid was received
from:
1.
Ken Garff Cheyenne

The bids were reviewed by Bryan Bell (Fleet Maintenance), Dennis Fanning (Street & Alley),
Vicki Nemecek (Public Works), and their recommendation is to accept the lowest responsive bid
from Ken Garff Cheyenne.

The Bidding Documents contain a Surcharge and Escalator – Special Provision, that allows for the
review of surcharges related to the following items:  Original Equipment Manufacturer (OEM)
and/or Body surcharges applied to the cost of the vehicles after the bid opening date & Model year
escalators.  The Surcharge & Escalator Contingency, is for an amount not-to-exceed Fifteen
Percent (15%), of the total value of  requested items on the Bid.  Calculated on the base cost of
trailer, the Surcharge amount to be included with this bid is $34,305.15.

The total requested bid award is for $221,806.15.
$228,701.00 Base Bid, Less (-$45,000) Trade In, Plus Add-On Warranty $3,800.00, Plus
Surcharge Contingency $34,305.15.

Funding:
020-26-2617-42-43102 (1% Sales Tax 19-22 / Equipment)
```

